  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.20 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.35. ACE-Step 1.5 text-to-music, checked against ComfyUI's own runs (audio_ace_step_1_5_split): AceStepGenerator (caption + lyrics, condition encoder, the diffusion transformer, the Oobleck VAE), the 1.7B audio-code LM with a KV cache (AceStepCodeLm: CFG, temperature, top-p / top-k / min-p), audio codes to hints (AceStepCodeDecoder), ComfyUI's prompt templates (AceStepPrompts), the VAE encoder, and ACE-Step's MIT silence latent. Qwen3KvDecoder (any Qwen3 size, KV cache); Flux2TextEncoder runs any Qwen3 size. The Oobleck VAE decodes 10 s of audio in 1.4 s (implicit-GEMM convolutions). See CHANGELOG.md.",
